  "bio": "Jieshin Tseng is a Taiwanese artist who graduated in 2026 with a BA (Hons) in Fine Art: Drawing from Camberwell College of Arts, University of the Arts London. Her practice spans installation, sculpture, and painting, with an interest in the characteristics of different materials, especially materials that cannot be permanently preserved or are often overlooked. She is also interested in time and traces. Her materials include rice milk, menstrual blood, hair, paper, branches, found and repurposed materials, and earth pigments.",
